  Notation: g = bi-invariant metric on the link group, unit round S^3 (lam_1 = 3).
            q_g = ||(Hess_g V)_-||  (dimensionless in group coordinates)
            t_g = heat-kernel time of g     => Q_g = int q_g dt_g  carries [t_g]

